* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Generic behavioural voltage-feedback operational amplifier macromodel (authored for Omnia)
* Specs (SQ8): A_OL = 100k, GBW = 3 MHz, R_in = 1 MOhm, R_out = 75 Ohm,
* diode rail clamp referenced to vcc/vee using R, C, E, G, D only.
.model OPAMP_CLAMP D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=1)

.subckt OPAMP_GENERIC inp inn vcc vee out
* Mid-supply reference
Rmid1 vcc mid 100k
Rmid2 mid vee 100k
* Differential and common-mode input impedance
Rin inp inn 1e6
Ricm1 inp mid 1e9
Ricm2 inn mid 1e9
* Dominant-pole gain stage: gm = 1 mS, Rgain = 100 MOhm -> A_OL = 1e5,
* f_p = 30 Hz -> Cgain = 53.0516 pF -> GBW = 3 MHz
G1 mid gain inp inn 1e-3
Rgain gain mid 1e8
Cgain gain mid 53.0516e-12
* Supply-referenced rail clamps
Ehi vhi mid vcc mid 0.9
Elo vlo mid vee mid 0.9
Dcp gain vhi OPAMP_CLAMP
Dcn vlo gain OPAMP_CLAMP
* Buffered output stage with 75 Ohm output resistance
Eout out_int mid gain mid 1.0
Rout out_int out 75
.ends OPAMP_GENERIC
